4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ol7KRcZ7LcgQ7kNvwHX3Jov&_nc_oc=Adof8qzXQfWyHEPhIDbfU9UvU42DtbaPWxxJA5ZlgHTAdBvNpskbwuUDRpnXlrEo2I0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4k1a7Uks4SeXe3uc74a6Eh2GfaubbFs9a3d_hh7jVGtw&oe=69FDDF54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_GDKd0AzuiIQ7kNvwG4xLhE&_nc_oc=AdqY5pxkyH-lbSMjtLbbRRMaKh095LRaBlcp7-QMWBVh2-M7yBUTpY9sBovfnUVN234&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7rJf-PDMX3EHE5faxGD9lwudZpGpzN0k6hV5GWuAFUGg&oe=69FDE432"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gfZnej_-IqUQ7kNvwEMCzqY&_nc_oc=AdpS4ur0GSWm-FEb1XJBOgQCm-picO0bRLp3sAXQA0Q7TTXeBN41CfLehTK0ViPmNrk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5VY5ubLozxi-irWOIKqiKY2Qabj6kIABrNKdK9xoS2xA&oe=69FDF1D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p